---
const caseStudy = {
  category: 'Caso real',
  title: 'Web para cirujano en Cuenca',
  sector: 'Salud / servicios profesionales',
  problem:
    'El reto era transmitir autoridad médica, explicar con claridad cuándo consultar y facilitar el agendamiento directo sin depender de formularios largos.',
  solution:
    'Se construyó una web enfocada en confianza, trayectoria, especialidades, proceso y CTA claros a WhatsApp para acelerar el contacto.',
  wins: [
    'Autoridad visible desde el primer pantallazo',
    'Servicios ordenados para reducir dudas',
    'Mensaje adaptado al tipo de paciente',
    'WhatsApp como acción principal',
  ],
  url: 'https://web-doctor-orpin.vercel.app/#inicio',
};
---

<section id="portfolio" class="py-24 px-6 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_rgba(59,130,246,0.07),_transparent_26%),linear-gradient(to_bottom,_#ffffff,_#f8fafc)] dark:bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_rgba(34,211,238,0.08),_transparent_26%),linear-gradient(to_bottom,_#020617,_#0f172a)]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div data-reveal class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-blue-200/70 dark:border-cyan-400/20 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/70 text-blue-700 dark:text-cyan-300 text-sm font-semibold mb-4 backdrop-blur">
        Portfolio
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        Un ejemplo real de cómo presentar mejor un servicio profesional
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        El objetivo no era “tener presencia”. Era que el profesional se viera más creíble, que el paciente entendiera mejor y que contactar fuera obvio.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] gap-8 items-stretch">
      <div data-reveal class="rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-[0_20px_55px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)]">
        <div class="mb-8 space-y-4">
          <div class="rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-3 shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(15,23,42,0.18)]">
            <div class="mb-3 hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 px-2">
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              <span class="ml-3 text-xs text-slate-400">web-doctor-orpin.vercel.app</span>
            </div>
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-white/10 bg-slate-900">
              <picture>
                <source
                  type="image/avif"
                  srcset="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-512.avif 512w, /images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-1024.avif 1024w"
                  sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw"
                />
                <source
                  type="image/webp"
                  srcset="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-512.webp 512w, /images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-1024.webp 1024w"
                  sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw"
                />
                <img src="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-1024.png" alt="Vista previa principal de la web médica del portafolio" width="1024" height="1024" class="h-auto max-h-[280px] sm:max-h-none w-full object-cover object-center" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              </picture>
              <div class="absolute left-3 top-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2 sm:left-4 sm:top-4">
                <span class="rounded-full bg-blue-600/90 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white backdrop-blur">Caso real</span>
                <span class="rounded-full bg-slate-950/65 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white backdrop-blur">Sector salud</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hidden sm:grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="rounded-[24px] border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-3 shadow-[0_18px_50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)]">
              <div class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400 px-1">Presentación</div>
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border border-white/10 bg-slate-900">
                <picture>
                  <source
                    type="image/avif"
                    srcset="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-384.avif 384w, /images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-512.avif 512w"
                    sizes="50vw"
                  />
                  <source
                    type="image/webp"
                    srcset="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-384.webp 384w, /images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-512.webp 512w"
                    sizes="50vw"
                  />
                  <img src="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-device-mockup-512.png" alt="Mockup principal de la web médica" width="512" height="512" class="h-auto w-full object-cover object-center" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                </picture>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[24px] border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-3 shadow-[0_18px_50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)]">
              <div class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400 px-1">Servicios</div>
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border border-white/10 bg-slate-900">
                <picture>
                  <source
                    type="image/avif"
                    srcset="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-services-384.avif 384w, /images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-services-512.avif 512w"
                    sizes="50vw"
                  />
                  <source
                    type="image/webp"
                    srcset="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-services-384.webp 384w, /images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-services-512.webp 512w"
                    sizes="50vw"
                  />
                  <img src="/images/portfolio/optimized/web-doctor-services-512.png" alt="Mockup de la sección de servicios de la web médica" width="512" height="512" class="h-auto w-full object-cover object-top" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                </picture>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white">{caseStudy.category}</span>
          <span class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">{caseStudy.sector}</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
          {caseStudy.title}
        </h3>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 p-5">
            <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue-600 dark:text-cyan-300 font-semibold mb-2">Problema</div>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">{caseStudy.problem}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 p-5">
            <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue-600 dark:text-cyan-300 font-semibold mb-2">Solución</div>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">{caseStudy.solution}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href={caseStudy.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20">
          Ver proyecto
        </a>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1" class="rounded-[32px] border border-cyan-300/15 bg-[linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(37,99,235,0.96),rgba(8,47,73,0.95))] p-8 md:p-10 text-white shadow-[0_28px_70px_rgba(37,99,235,0.25)]">
        <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-100 font-semibold mb-4">Qué prueba este caso</div>
        <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          {caseStudy.wins.map((win) => (
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/8 px-4 py-4 backdrop-blur-sm">{win}</div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/20 p-5">
          <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-100 font-semibold mb-2">Qué logra esta web</div>
          <p class="text-slate-100 leading-relaxed">
            Una web bien planteada reduce fricción: el visitante entiende quién eres, por qué confiar y cuál es el siguiente paso.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
